[33.702062,"o","\u001b[2;133H\u001b[1K\u001b[2m\r╭─────────────────────────────────────────────╮\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[3;133H\u001b[1K\u001b[2m\r│ >_ \u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[1mOpenAI Codex\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[2m (v0.120.0)                  │\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[4;133H\u001b[1K\u001b[2m\r│                                             │\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[5;133H\u001b[1K\u001b[2m\r│ model:     \u001b(B\u001b[mgpt-5.4 xhigh\u001b[2m   \u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[36m/model\u001b[39m\u001b[2m to change │\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[6;133H\u001b[1K\u001b[2m\r│ directory: \u001b(B\u001b[m/demo/miniOdyssey\u001b[2m    │\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[7;133H\u001b[1K\u001b[2m\r╰─────────────────────────────────────────────╯\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[8;133H\u001b[1K\r\n  \u001b[1mTip:\u001b(B\u001b[m \u001b[7mNew\u001b(B\u001b[m Use \u001b[1m/fast\u001b(B\u001b[m to enable our fastest inference at 2X plan usage.\u001b[63X\u001b[10;133H\u001b[1K\u001b[48;5;238m\n\u001b[1K\u001b[1m\u001b[2m\r\n› \u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[48;5;238m$miniOdyssey Please help diagnose a patient with these symptoms:\u001b[67X\u001b[13;133H\u001b[1K\r\n  - Coarse facial features (HP:0000280)\u001b[94X\r\n  - Eczematoid dermatitis (HP:0000976)\u001b[95X\r\n  - Increased total eosinophil count (HP:0001880)\u001b[84X\r\n  - Recurrent Staphylococcus aureus infections (HP:0002726)\u001b[74X\r\n  - Decreased neutrophil oxidative burst (HP:0003203)\u001b[80X\r\n  - Increased circulating IgE concentration (HP:0003212)\u001b[77X\r\n  - Recurrent pneumonia (HP:0006532)\u001b[97X\r\n  - Prominent forehead (HP:0011220)\u001b[98X\r\n  - Pulmonary pneumatocele (HP:0025419)\u001b[94X\r\n  - Cutaneous abscess (HP:0031292)\u001b[99X\r\n  - Abnormal CD4+ T cell subset proportion (HP:0031392)\u001b[78X\r\n  - Abnormal CD8+ T cell proportion (HP:0031393)\u001b[85X\u001b[26;133H\u001b[1K\r\n  No excluded features were provided.\u001b[96X\u001b[28;133H\u001b[1K\r\n  Use only the symptoms shown here and the bundled dx-toolkit tools in the current workspace. Do not inspect local case files or\u001b[5X\r\n  other repo files. Do not search for case IDs, runtime helpers, package roots, or alternate tool locations. Do not mention local\u001b[4X\r\n  file names or paths in your visible narration. Begin directly with the diagnosis workflow.\u001b[41X\u001b[32;133H\u001b[1K\u001b[49m\n\u001b[1K\u001b[2m\r\n• \u001b(B\u001b[mUsing the miniOdyssey workflow. I’m loading its instructions first, then I’ll run the phenotype-driven ranking against the symptom\u001b[1X\n\u001b[1K\r  list and synthesize the diagnosis from those tool results.\u001b[36;133H\u001b[1K\n\u001b[1K\u001b[2m\r•\u001b(B\u001b[m \u001b[1mExplored\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[38;133H\u001b[1K\u001b[2m\r  └ \u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[36mRead\u001b[39m SKILL.md (miniOdyssey skill)\u001b[39;133H\u001b[1K\u001b[2m\r\n─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[41;133H\u001b[1K\u001b[2m\r\n• \u001b(B\u001b[mI have the workflow constraints. Next I’m pulling the reasoning and output guidance, then I’ll run the first disease-family query\u001b[2X\r\n  from the phenotype anchors: hyper-IgE, staphylococcal skin/lung infections, pneumatoceles, and impaired oxidative burst.\u001b[11X\u001b[44;133H\u001b[1K\n\u001b[1K\u001b[2m\r•\u001b(B\u001b[m \u001b[1mExplored\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[2m\r\n  └ \u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[36mRead\u001b[39m clinical-reasoning.md\u001b[2m, \u001b(B\u001b[mtool-selection-guide.md\u001b[2m, \u001b(B\u001b[mdemo-output-style.md\u001b[56X\u001b[47;133H\u001b[1K\u001b[2m\r\n• \u001b[7mI’m planning to run a commentary update that focuses on potential medical conditions. The pattern suggests hyper-IgE/primary\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[7X\r\n  \u001b[2m\u001b[7mimmunodeficiency, with chronic granulomatous disease as a significant alternative. To ensure thoroughness, I’ll approach this with\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[1X\r\n  \u001b[2m\u001b[7mfour views in parallel: a full phenotype ranking, a focused rescue pass, a disease-family lookup, and a keyword disease search.\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[4X\u001b[51;133H\u001b[1K\r  \u001b[2m\u001b[7mThen, I’ll execute the plan to gather detailed information.\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[52;133H\u001b[1K\u001b[2m\r\n──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────"]
