nd the bundled dx-toolkit tools in the current workspace. Do not inspect local case files or other \u001b[39m \u001b[38;5;231m\u001b[30;135Hrepo files. Do not search for case IDs, runtime helpers, package roots, or alternate tool locations. Do not mention local file names \u001b[39m \u001b[38;5;231m\u001b[31;135Hor paths in your visible narration. Begin directly with the diagnosis workflow.\u001b[39m                                                       \u001b[49m\u001b[32;135H\u001b[K\n \u001b[1X\u001b[38;5;246m\u001b[CRead \u001b[1m2\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[38;5;246m files (ctrl+o to expand)\u001b[39m       \u001b[K\u001b[34;135H                                  "]
