reased neutrophil oxidative burst (HP:0003203)\u001b[39m                                                                                   \u001b[38;5;231m\u001b[14;135H- Increased circulating IgE concentration (HP:0003212)\u001b[39m                                                                                \u001b[38;5;231m\u001b[15;135H- Recurrent pneumonia (HP:0006532)\u001b[39m                                                                                                    \u001b[38;5;231m\u001b[16;135H- Prominent forehead (HP:0011220)\u001b[39m                                                                                                     \u001b[38;5;231m\u001b[17;135H- Pulmonary pneumatocele (HP:0025419)\u001b[39m                                                                                                 \u001b[38;5;231m\u001b[18;135H- Cutaneous abscess (HP:0031292)\u001b[39m                                                                                                      \u001b[38;5;231m\u001b[19;135H- Abnormal CD4+ T cell subset proportion (HP:0031392)\u001b[39m                                                                                 \u001b[38;5;231m\u001b[20;135H- Abnormal CD8+ T cell proportion (HP:0031393)\u001b[39m                                                                                        \u001b[21;135H                                                                                                                                      \u001b[38;5;231m\u001b[22;135HNo excluded features were provided.\u001b[39m                                                                                                   \u001b[23;135H                                                                                                                                      \u001b[38;5;231m\u001b[24;135HUse only the symptoms shown here and the bundled dx-toolkit tools in the current workspace. Do not inspect local case files or other \u001b[39m \u001b[38;5;231m\u001b[25;135Hrepo files. Do not search for case IDs, runtime helpers, package roots, or alternate tool locations. Do not mention local file names \u001b[39m \u001b[38;5;231m\u001b[26;135Hor paths in your visible narration. Begin directly with the diagnosis workflow.\u001b[39m                                                       \u001b[49m\u001b[27;135H\u001b[K\n \u001b[1X\u001b[38;5;246m\u001b[CRead \u001b[1m2\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[38;5;246m files (ctrl+o to expand)\u001b[39m       \u001b[K\u001b[29;135H                                                     \u001b[K\u001b[38;5;231m\u001b[30;135H●\u001b[39m I'll work the case with the dx-toolkit. The syndrome anchors are: pulmonary pneumatoceles + cold abscesses + very high IgE + eczema \u001b[31;135H  + coarse facies + prominent "]
