[136.640773,"o","──\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[47;133H\u001b[1K\u001b[2m\r\n• \u001b(B\u001b[mThe literature tie-breaker is useful: classic hyper-IgE syndrome is showing up with pneumatoceles and staphylococcal infection\u001b[5X\r\n  patterns, but not with a clean canonical oxidative-burst defect. I’m doing one last syndrome-pattern search to confirm whether the\u001b[1X\r\n  facial phenotype plus pneumatoceles tracks with Job syndrome specifically.\u001b[57X\u001b[51;133H\u001b[1K\u001b[32m\u001b[1m\r\n•\u001b(B\u001b[m \u001b[1mRan\u001b(B\u001b[m \u001b[38;5;111mdx-pubmed\u001b[38;5;189m search\u001b[38;5;103m --\u001b[38;5;217mquery\u001b[38;5;189m \u001b[38;5;151m\"Job syndrome pneumatoceles coarse facies\"\u001b[38;5;103m --\u001b[38;5;217mabstracts\u001b[39m\u001b[48X\u001b[53;133H\u001b[1K\u001b[2m\r  └ {\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[54;133H\u001b[1K\r    \u001b[2m  \"query\": \"Job syndrome pneumatoceles coarse facies\",\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[55;133H\u001b[1K\u001b[2m\r    … +2 lines (ctrl + t to view transcript)\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[56;133H\u001b[1K\r    \u001b[2m  \"papers\": []\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[57;133H\u001b[1K\r    \u001b[2m}\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[58;133H\u001b[1K\u001b[32m\u001b[1m\r\n•\u001b(B\u001b[m \u001b[1mRan\u001b(B\u001b[m \u001b[38;5;111mdx-pubmed\u001b[38;5;189m search\u001b[38;5;103m --\u001b[38;5;217mquery\u001b[38;5;189m \u001b[38;5;151m\"hyper IgE syndrome staphylococcal abscess pneumatocele\"\u001b[38;5;103m --\u001b[38;5;217mabstracts\u001b[39m\u001b[34X\u001b[60;133H\u001b[1K\u001b[2m\r  └ {\u001b(B\u001b[m\r\n    \u001b[2m  \"query\": \"hyper IgE syndrome staphylococcal abscess pneumatocele\",\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[61X\u001b[62;133H\u001b[1K\u001b[2m\r    … +182 lines (ctrl + t to view transcript)\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[63;133H\u001b[1K\r    \u001b[2m  ]\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[64;133H\u001b[1K\r    \u001b[2m}\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[65;133H\u001b[1K\u001b[2m\r\n◦\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[1X\u001b[2m\u001b[CWaiting for background\u001b(B\u001b[m \u001b[1mtermi\u001b(B\u001b[mn\u001b[2mal\u001b(B\u001b[m \u001b[2m(2m 16s • esc to interrupt)\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[72X\u001b[67;133H\u001b[1K\u001b[48;5;238m\r\n \u001b[132X\u001b[1m\r\n›\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[48;5;238m \u001b[2mImplement {feature}\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[48;5;238m\u001b[112X\r\n \u001b[132X\u001b[49m\u001b[71;133H\u001b[1K\u001b[2m\r  gpt-5.4 xhigh · /demo/miniOdyssey\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[2;135H   — 7/12 terms, the highest overlap. Let me verify with OMIM.                                                                        \u001b[3;135H                                               \u001b[K\u001b[38;5;114m\u001b[4;135H●\u001b[39m \u001b[1mBash\u001b(B\u001b[m(dx-omim gene --name \"STAT3\")                                                                                                   \u001b[38;5;246m\u001b[5;135H  ⎿  \u001b[39m{                                                                                                                                \u001b[6;135H       \"gene\": \"STAT3\",                                                                                                               \u001b[7;135H       \"gene_info\": {                                                                                                                 \u001b[8;135H     \u001b[2m… +21 lines (ctrl+o to expand)\u001b(B\u001b[m                                                                                                   \u001b[9;135H                                                                                                                                      \u001b[38;5;114m\u001b[10;135H●\u001b[39m \u001b[1mBash\u001b(B\u001b[m(dx-omim gene --name \"IL6ST\")                \u001b[K\u001b[38;5;246m\u001b[11;135H  ⎿  \u001b[39m{                                                                                                                                \u001b[12;135H       \"gene\": \"IL6ST\",                                                