[139.750507,"o","\u001b[2m\u001b[2;1H• \u001b(B\u001b[mThe disease-first checks split cleanly: oxidative-burst queries strongly recover chronic granulomatous disease, while the hyper-IgE\r\n  family remains the better multisystem frame. I’m pulling the last constraint output now and then I can make the final call between\u001b[1X\n\u001b[1K\r  “true CGD” and “hyper-IgE syndrome with a CGD-like lab clue.”\u001b[5;133H\u001b[1K\u001b[1m\r\n• Waited for background terminal\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[2m · timeout 30s dx-gene-evidence --genes \"STAT3,DOCK8,IL6ST,ZNF341,NCF2,CYBB\"\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[25X\u001b[7;133H\u001b[1K\u001b[32m\u001b[1m\r\n•\u001b(B\u001b[m \u001b[1mRan\u001b(B\u001b[m \u001b[38;5;111mtimeout\u001b[38;5;189m 30s dx-gene-evidence\u001b[38;5;103m --\u001b[38;5;217mgenes\u001b[38;5;189m \u001b[38;5;151m\"STAT3,DOCK8,IL6ST,ZNF341,NCF2,CYBB\"\u001b[39m\u001b[54X\u001b[9;133H\u001b[1K\u001b[2m\r  └ {\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[10;133H\u001b[1K\r    \u001b[2m  \"STAT3\": {\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[11;133H\u001b[1K\u001b[2m\r    … +155 lines (ctrl + t to view transcript)\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[12;133H\u001b[1K\r    \u001b[2m  }\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[13;133H\u001b[1K\r    \u001b[2m}\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[14;133H\u001b[1K\n\u001b[1K\u001b[1m\r• Waited for background terminal\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[16;133H\u001b[1K\u001b[2m\r\n─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[18;133H\u001b[1K\u001b[2m\r\n• \u001b(B\u001b[mThe remaining uncertainty is inside the hyper-IgE family and around that oxidative-burst result. I’m using the literature view as a\r\n  tie-breaker now: one search for the overall syndrome pattern without naming a gene, and one search focused on whether oxidative-\u001b[3X\u001b[21;133H\u001b[1K\r  burst defects have been described in hyper-IgE presentations.\u001b[22;133H\u001b[1K\u001b[32m\u001b[1m\r\n•\u001b(B\u001b[m \u001b[1mRan\u001b(B\u001b[m \u001b[38;5;111mdx-pubmed\u001b[38;5;189m search\u001b[38;5;103m --\u001b[38;5;217mquery\u001b[38;5;189m \u001b[38;5;151m\"hyper IgE pneumatoceles coarse facies staphylococcal abscess\"\u001b[38;5;103m --\u001b[38;5;217mabstracts\u001b[39m\u001b[28X\u001b[24;133H\u001b[1K\u001b[2m\r  └ {\u001b(B\u001b[m\r\n    \u001b[2m  \"query\": \"hyper IgE pneumatoceles coarse facies staphylococcal abscess\",\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[55X\u001b[26;133H\u001b[1K\u001b[2m\r    … +2 lines (ctrl + t to view transcript)\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[27;133H\u001b[1K\r    \u001b[2m  \"papers\": []\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[28;133H\u001b[1K\r    \u001b[2m}\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[29;133H\u001b[1K\u001b[32m\u001b[1m\r\n•\u001b(B\u001b[m \u001b[1mRan\u001b(B\u001b[m \u001b[38;5;111mdx-pubmed\u001b[38;5;189m search\u001b[38;5;103m --\u001b[38;5;217mquery\u001b[38;5;189m \u001b[38;5;151m\"neutrophil oxidative burst hyper IgE syndrome\"\u001b[38;5;103m --\u001b[38;5;217mabstracts\u001b[39m\u001b[43X\u001b[31;133H\u001b[1K\u001b[2m\r  └ {\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[32;133H\u001b[1K\r    \u001b[2m  \"query\": \"neutrophil oxidative burst hyper IgE syndrome\",\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[33;133H\u001b[1K\u001b[2m\r    … +106 lines (ctrl + t to view transcript)\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[34;133H\u001b[1K\r    \u001b[2m  ]\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[35;133H\u001b[1K\r    \u001b[2m}\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[36;133H\u001b[1K\u001b[2m\r\n─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[38;133H\u001b[1K\u001b[2m\r\n• \u001b(B\u001b[mThe literature tie-breaker is useful: classic hyper-IgE syndrome is showing up with pneumatoceles and staphylococcal infection\u001b[5X\r\n  patterns, but not with a clean canonical oxidative-burst defect. I’m doing one last syndrome-pattern search to confirm whether the\u001b[1X\r\n  facial phenotype plus pneumatoceles tracks with Job syndrome specifically.\u001b[57X\u001b[42;133H\u001b[1K\u001b[32m\u001b[1m\r\n•\u001b(B\u001b[m \u001b[1mRan\u001b(B\u001b[m \u001b[38;5;111mdx-pubmed\u001b[38;5;189m search\u001b[38;5;103m --\u001b[38;5;217mquery\u001b[38;5;189m \u001b[38;5;151m\"Job syndrome pneumatoceles coarse facies\"\u001b[38;5;103m --\u001b[38;5;217mabstracts\u001b[39m\u001b[48X\u001b[44;133H\u001b[1K\u001b[2m\r  └ {\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[45;133H\u001b[1K\r    \u001b[2m  \"query\": \"Job syndrome pneumatoceles coarse facies\",\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[46;133H\u001b[1K\u001b[2m\r    … +2 lines (ctrl + t to view transcript)\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[47;133H\u001b[1K\r    \u001b[2m  \"papers\": []\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[48;133H\u001b[1K\r    \u001b[2m}\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[49;133H\u001b[1K\u001b[32m\u001b[1m\r\n•\u001b(B\u001b[m \u001b[1mRan\u001b(B\u001b[m \u001b[38;5;111mdx-pubmed\u001b[38;5;189m search\u001b[38;5;103m --\u001b[38;5;217mquery\u001b[38;5;189m \u001b[38;5;151m\"hyper IgE syndrome staphylococcal abscess pneumatocele\"\u001b[38;5;103m --\u001b[38;5;217mabstracts\u001b[39m\u001b[34X\u001b[51;133H\u001b[1K\u001b[2m\r  └ {\u001b(B\u001b[m\r\n    \u001b[2m  \"query\": \"hyper IgE syndrome staphylococcal abscess pneumatocele\",\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[61X\u001b[53;133H\u001b[1K\u001b[2m\r    … +182 lines (ctrl + t to view transcript)\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[54;133H\u001b[1K\r    \u001b[2m  ]\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[55;133H\u001b[1K\r    \u001b[2m}\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[56;133H\u001b[1K\u001b[2m\r\n• \u001b[7mI'm looking into the hyper-IgE family and the CGD family; it seems like tools and evidence point toward hyper-IgE, especially when\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[1X\r\n  \u001b[2m\u001b[7mconsidering disease-specific queries regarding staph abscesses and pneumatocele. This observation strongly supports the hyper-IgE\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[2X\r\n  \u001b[2m\u001b[7mconnection. I wonder if the scores within the hyper-IgE family are close to confirm this theory. There’s definitely more to explore\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[60;133H\u001b[1K\r  \u001b[2m\u001b[7mhere!\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[61;133H\u001b[1K\n\u001b[1K\u001b[1m\r• Waited for background terminal\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[63;133H\u001b[1K\n\u001b[1K\n\u001b[1K\r\n•\u001b[1X\u001b[1m\u001b[CWait\u001b(B\u001b[mi\u001b[2mng for background terminal\u001b(B\u001b[m \u001b[2m(2m 19s • esc to interrupt)\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[72X\u001b[67;133H\u001b[1K\u001b[48;5;238m\r\n \u001b[132X\u001b[1m\r\n›\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[48;5;238m \u001b[2mImplement {feature}\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[48;5;238m\u001b[112X\r\n \u001b[132X\u001b[49m\u001b[71;133H\u001b[1K\u001b[2m\r  gpt-5.4 xhigh · /demo/miniOdyssey\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[67;137H\u001b[64;1H\u001b[2m─\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[?12l\u001b[?25h\u001b[?1006l\u001b[?1000l\u001b[?1002l\u001b[?1003l\u001b[1;1H\u001b[1;72r\u001b[64;2H\u001b[2m────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\u001b[66;3HWorki\u001b[2C\u001b(B\u001b[m \u001b[2m(2m\u001b[C19s \u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[19C\u001b[96X\u001b[48;5;238m\u001b[68;2H\u001b[132X\u001b[69;22H\u001b[112X\u001b[70;2H\u001b[132X\u001b[49m\u001b[71;48H\u001b[86X\u001b[66;19H\u001b[2m• esc to interrupt)\u001b[67;137H\u001b[?25l\u001b[?1006l\u001b[?1000l\u001b[?1002l\u001b[?1003l\u001b[?1006h\u001b[?1000h\u001b[?1002h\u001b(B\u001b[m"]
