[144.139032,"o","\u001b[?25l\u001b[1m\u001b[2;1H• Waited for background terminal\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[2m · timeout 30s dx-gene-evidence --genes \"STAT3,DOCK8,IL6ST,ZNF341,NCF2,CYBB\"\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[25X\u001b[3;133H\u001b[1K\u001b[32m\u001b[1m\r\n•\u001b(B\u001b[m \u001b[1mRan\u001b(B\u001b[m \u001b[38;5;111mtimeout\u001b[38;5;189m 30s dx-gene-evidence\u001b[38;5;103m --\u001b[38;5;217mgenes\u001b[38;5;189m \u001b[38;5;151m\"STAT3,DOCK8,IL6ST,ZNF341,NCF2,CYBB\"\u001b[39m\u001b[54X\u001b[5;133H\u001b[1K\u001b[2m\r  └ {\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[6;133H\u001b[1K\r    \u001b[2m  \"STAT3\": {\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[7;133H\u001b[1K\u001b[2m\r    … +155 lines (ctrl + t to view transcript)\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[8;133H\u001b[1K\r    \u001b[2m  }\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[9;133H\u001b[1K\r    \u001b[2m}\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[10;133H\u001b[1K\n\u001b[1K\u001b[1m\r• Waited for background terminal\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[12;133H\u001b[1K\u001b[2m\r\n─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[14;133H\u001b[1K\u001b[2m\r\n• \u001b(B\u001b[mThe remaining uncertainty is inside the hyper-IgE family and around that oxidative-burst result. I’m using the literature view as a\r\n  tie-breaker now: one search for the overall syndrome pattern without naming a gene, and one search focused on whether oxidative-\u001b[3X\u001b[17;133H\u001b[1K\r  burst defects have been described in hyper-IgE presentations.\u001b[18;133H\u001b[1K\u001b[32m\u001b[1m\r\n•\u001b(B\u001b[m \u001b[1mRan\u001b(B\u001b[m \u001b[38;5;111mdx-pubmed\u001b[38;5;189m search\u001b[38;5;103m --\u001b[38;5;217mquery\u001b[38;5;189m \u001b[38;5;151m\"hyper IgE pneumatoceles coarse facies staphylococcal abscess\"\u001b[38;5;103m --\u001b[38;5;217mabstracts\u001b[39m\u001b[28X\u001b[20;133H\u001b[1K\u001b[2m\r  └ {\u001b(B\u001b[m\r\n    \u001b[2m  \"query\": \"hyper IgE pneumatoceles coarse facies staphylococcal absces