[150.509088,"o","\u001b[?25l\u001b[2;133H\u001b[1K\r    \u001b[2m  \"papers\": []\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[3;133H\u001b[1K\r    \u001b[2m}\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[4;133H\u001b[1K\u001b[32m\u001b[1m\r\n•\u001b(B\u001b[m \u001b[1mRan\u001b(B\u001b[m \u001b[38;5;111mdx-pubmed\u001b[38;5;189m search\u001b[38;5;103m --\u001b[38;5;217mquery\u001b[38;5;189m \u001b[38;5;151m\"neutrophil oxidative burst hyper IgE syndrome\"\u001b[38;5;103m --\u001b[38;5;217mabstracts\u001b[39m\u001b[43X\u001b[6;133H\u001b[1K\u001b[2m\r  └ {\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[7;133H\u001b[1K\r    \u001b[2m  \"query\": \"neutrophil oxidative burst hyper IgE syndrome\",\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[8;133H\u001b[1K\u001b[2m\r    … +106 lines (ctrl + t to view transcript)\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[9;133H\u001b[1K\r    \u001b[2m  ]\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[10;133H\u001b[1K\r    \u001b[2m}\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[11;133H\u001b[1K\u001b[2m\r\n─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[13;133H\u001b[1K\u001b[2m\r\n• \u001b(B\u001b[mThe literature tie-breaker is useful: classic hyper-IgE syndrome is showing up with pneumatoceles and staphylococcal infection\u001b[5X\r\n  patterns, but not with a clean canonical oxidative-burst defect. I’m doing one last syndrome-pattern search to confirm whether the\u001b[1X\r\n  facial phenotype plus pneumatoceles tracks with Job syndrome specifically.\u001b[57X\u001b[17;133H\u001b[1K\u001b[32m\u001b[1m\r\n•\u001b(B\u001b[m \u001b[1mRan\u001b(B\u001b[m \u001b[38;5;111mdx-pubmed\u001b[38;5;189m search\u001b[38;5;103m --\u001b[38;5;217mquery\u001b[38;5;189m \u001b[38;5;151m\"Job syndrome pneumatoceles coarse facies\"\u001b[38;5;103m --\u001b[38;5;217mabstracts\u001b[39m\u001b[48X\u001b[19;133H\u001b[1K\u001b[2m\r  └ {\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[20;133H\u001b[1K\r    \u001b[2m  \"query\": \"Job syndrome pneumatoceles coarse facies\",\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[21;133H\u001b[1K\u001b[2m\r    … +2 lines (ctrl + t to view transcript)\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[22;133H\u001b[1K\r    \u001b[2m  \"papers\": []\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[23;133H\u001b[1K\r    \u001b[2m}\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[24;133H\u001b[1K\u001b[32m\u001b[1m\r\n•\u001b(B\u001b[m \u001b[1mRan\u001b(B\u001b[m \u001b[38;5;111mdx-pubmed\u001b[38;5;189m search\u001b[38;5;103m --\u001b[38;5;217mquery\u001b[38;5;189m \u001b[38;5;151m\"hyper IgE syndrome staphylococcal abscess pneumatocele\"\u001b[38;5;103m --\u001b[38;5;217mabstracts\u001b[39m\u001b[34X\u001b[26;133H\u001b[1K\u001b[2m\r  └ {\u001b(B\u001b[m\r\n    \u001b[2m  \"query\": \"hyper IgE syndrome staphylococcal abscess pneumatocele\",\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[61X\u001b[28;133H\u001b[1K\u001b[2m\r    … +182 lines (ctrl + t to view transcript)\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[29;133H\u001b[1K\r    \u001b[2m  ]\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[30;133H\u001b[1K\r    \u001b[2m}\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[31;133H\u001b[1K\u001b[2m\r\n• \u001b[7mI'm looking into the hyper-IgE family and the CGD family; it seems like tools and evidence point toward hyper-IgE, especially when\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[1X\r\n  \u001b[2m\u001b[7mconsidering disease-specific queries regarding staph abscesses and pneumatocele. This observation strongly supports the hyper-IgE\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[2X\r\n  \u001b[2m\u001b[7mconnection. I wonder if the scores within the hyper-IgE family are close to confirm this theory. There’s definitely more to explore\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[35;133H\u001b[1K\r  \u001b[2m\u001b[7mhere!\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[36;133H\u001b[1K\n\u001b[1K\u001b[1m\r• Waited for background terminal\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[38;133H\u001b[1K\u001b[2m\r\n─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[40;133H\u001b[1K\u001b[2m\r\n• \u001b(B\u001b[mOne more internal family comparison is worth doing because the broad ranking also surfaced an upstream STAT3-pathway gene. I’m\u001b[5X\r\n  checking whether the literature links pneumatoceles and facial features more tightly to classic STAT3 disease, to IL6ST\u001b[12X\u001b[43;133H\u001b[1K\r  phenocopies, or to DOCK8 deficiency.\u001b[44;133H\u001b[1K\u001b[32m\u001b[1m\r\n•\u001b(B\u001b[m \u001b[1mRan\u001b(B\u001b[m \u001b[38;5;111mdx-pubmed\u001b[38;5;189m search\u001b[38;5;103m --\u001b[38;5;217mquery\u001b[38;5;189m \u001b[38;5;151m\"DOCK8 hyper IgE syndrome pneumatoceles facial features\"\u001b[38;5;103m --\u001b[38;5;217mabstracts\u001b[39m\u001b[34X\u001b[46;133H\u001b[1K\u001b[2m\r  └ {\u001b(B\u001b[m\r\n    \u001b[2m  \"query\": \"DOCK8 hyper IgE syndrome pneumatoceles facial features\",\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[61X\u001b[48;133H\u001b[1K\u001b[2m\r    … +39 lines (ctrl + t to view transcript)\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[49;13"]
