[194.036361,"o","\u001b[?25l\u001b[2;133H\u001b[1K\u001b[32m\u001b[1m\r\n•\u001b(B\u001b[m \u001b[1mRan\u001b(B\u001b[m \u001b[38;5;111mdx-pubmed\u001b[38;5;189m search\u001b[38;5;103m --\u001b[38;5;217mquery\u001b[38;5;189m \u001b[38;5;151m\"hyper IgE syndrome staphylococcal abscess pneumatocele\"\u001b[38;5;103m --\u001b[38;5;217mabstracts\u001b[39m\u001b[34X\u001b[4;133H\u001b[1K\u001b[2m\r  └ {\u001b(B\u001b[m\r\n    \u001b[2m  \"query\": \"hyper IgE syndrome staphylococcal abscess pneumatocele\",\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[61X\u001b[6;133H\u001b[1K\u001b[2m\r    … +182 lines (ctrl + t to view transcript)\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[7;133H\u001b[1K\r    \u001b[2m  ]\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[8;133H\u001b[1K\r    \u001b[2m}\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[9;133H\u001b[1K\u001b[2m\r\n• \u001b[7mI'm looking into the hyper-IgE family and the CGD family; it seems like tools and evidence point toward hyper-IgE, especially when\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[1X\r\n  \u001b[2m\u001b[7mconsidering disease-specific queries regarding staph abscesses and pneumatocele. This observation strongly supports the hyper-IgE\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[2X\r\n  \u001b[2m\u001b[7mconnection. I wonder if the scores within the hyper-IgE family are close to confirm this theory. There’s definitely more to explore\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[13;133H\u001b[1K\r  \u001b[2m\u001b[7mhere!\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[14;133H\u001b[1K\n\u001b[1K\u001b[1m\r• Waited for background terminal\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[16;133H\u001b[1K\u001b[2m\r\n─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[18;133H\u001b[1K\u001b[2m\r\n• \u001b(B\u001b[mOne more internal family comparison is worth doing because the broad ranking also surfaced an upstream STAT3-pathway gene. I’m\u001b[5X\r\n  checking whether the literature links pneumatoceles and facial features more tightly to classic STAT3 disease, to IL6ST\u001b[12X\u001b[21;133H\u001b[1K\r  phenocopies, or to DOCK8 deficiency.\u001b[22;133H\u001b[1K\u001b[32m\u001b[1m\r\n•\u001b(B\u001b[m \u001b[1mRan\u001b(B\u001b[m \u001b[38;5;111mdx-pubmed\u001b[38;5;189m search\u001b[38;5;103m --\u001b[38;5;217mquery\u001b[38;5;189m \u001b[38;5;151m\"DOCK8 hyper IgE syndrome pneumatoceles facial features\"\u001b[38;5;103m --\u001b[38;5;217mabstracts\u001b[39m\u001b[34X\u001b[24;133H\u001b[1K\u001b[2m\r  └ {\u001b(B\u001b[m\r\n    \u001b[2m  \"query\": \"DOCK8 hyper IgE syndrome pneumatoceles facial features\",\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[61X\u001b[26;133H\u001b[1K\u001b[2m\r    … +39 lines (ctrl + t to view transcript)\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[27;133H\u001b[1K\r    \u001b[2m  ]\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[28;133H\u001b[1K\r    \u001b[2m}\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[29;133H\u001b[1K\u001b[32m\u001b[1m\r\n•\u001b(B\u001b[m \u001b[1mRan\u001b(B\u001b[m \u001b[38;5;111mdx-pubmed\u001b[38;5;189m search\u001b[38;5;103m --\u001b[38;5;217mquery\u001b[38;5;189m \u001b[38;5;151m\"IL6ST hyper IgE syndrome pneumatocele\"\u001b[38;5;103m --\u001b[38;5;217mabstracts\u001b[39m\u001b[51X\u001b[31;133H\u001b[1K\u001b[2m\r  └ {\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[32;133H\u001b[1K\r    \u001b[2m  \"query\": \"IL6ST hyper IgE syndrome pneumatocele\",\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[33;133H\u001b[1K\u001b[2m\r    … +49 lines (ctrl + t to view transcript)\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[34;133H\u001b[1K\r    \u001b[2m  ]\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[35;133H\u001b[1K\r    \u001b[2m}\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[36;133H\u001b[1K\u001b[32m\u001b[1m\r\n•\u001b(B\u001b[m \u001b[1mRan\u001b(B\u001b[m \u001b[38;5;111mdx-pubmed\u001b[38;5;189m search\u001b[38;5;103m --\u001b[38;5;217mquery\u001b[38;5;189m \u001b[38;5;151m\"ZNF341 hyper IgE syndrome facial features\"\u001b[38;5;103m --\u001b[38;5;217mabstracts\u001b[39m\u001b[47X\u001b[38;133H\u001b[1K\u001b[2m\r  └ {\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[39;133H\u001b[1K\r    \u001b[2m  \"query\": \"ZNF341 hyper IgE syndrome facial features\",\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[40;133H\u001b[1K\u001b[2m\r    … +82 lines (ctrl + t to view transcript)\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[41;133H\u001b[1K\r    \u001b[2m  ]\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[42;133H\u001b[1K\r    \u001b[2m}\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[43;133H\u001b[1K\u001b[2m\r\n• \u001b[7mI'm looking into IL6ST variants and their relationship with STAT3, particularly how they can lead to \"original hyper-IgE syndrome.\"\u001b(B\u001b[m\r\n  \u001b[2m\u001b[7mI wonder if there's a way to differentiate the cases related to IL6ST, especially since dysmorphic facies could also be involved.\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[2X\r\n  \u001b[2m\u001b[7mIt's interesting to consider the implications of these genetic factors and how they might manifest in different individuals. Let's\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[1X\n\u001b[1K\r  \u001b[2m\u001b[7msee what more I can find on this topic!\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[48;133H\u001b[1K\n\u001b[1K\r  \u001b[1m\u001b[2m\u001b[7mEvaluating differential diagnoses\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[50;133H\u001b[1K\r\n  \u001b[2m\u001b[7mThis seems like a solid plan. The differential includes Chronic Granulomatous Disease (CGD), but I wonder if it’s a more nuanced\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[3X\r\n  \u001b[2m\u001b[7mclinical picture. Maybe I need to consider IL6ST/ZNF341 either as a sep"]
[194.036405,"o","arate differential or grouped with others. If I were to rank\u001b(B\u001b[m\r\n  \u001b[2m\u001b[7mthem, I think I could go with: 1) DOCK8 deficiency, 2) IL6ST/ZNF341-related hyper-IgE syndrome, and 3) Chronic Granulomatous\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[7X\u001b[54;133H\u001b[1K\r  \u001b[2m\u001b[7mDisease. Overall, this feels coherent.\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[55;133H\u001b[1K\n\u001b[1K\r  \u001b[1m\u001b[2m\u001b[7mCrafting concise diagnoses\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[57;133H\u001b[1K\r\n  \u001b[2m\u001b[7mI'm comparing top diagnoses, including DOCK8 and mentioning Chronic Granulomatous Disease (CGD). I should list genetics,\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[11X\r\n  \u001b[2m\u001b[7mparticularly focusing on IL6ST/ZNF341, noting DOCK8 as a potential differential. Maybe I can state, \"The best single diagnosis is\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[2X\r\n  \u001b[2m\u001b[7mSTAT3-related autosomal dominant hyper-IgE syndrome 1 (Job syndrome; STAT3, OMIM 147060)\" while including other possibilities like\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[1X\r\n  \u001b[2m\u001b[7mIL6ST and ZNF341. I really want to keep the bullets concise but informative, aiming for four key points without overcrowding the\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[3X\u001b[62;133H\u001b[1K\r  \u001b[2m\u001b[7mparagraph.\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[63;133H\u001b[1K\n\u001b[1K\n\u001b[1K\u001b[2m\r\n◦\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[1X\u001b[2m\u001b[CCraf\u001b(B\u001b[mt\u001b[1ming c\u001b(B\u001b[mo\u001b[2mncise diagnoses\u001b(B\u001b[m \u001b[2m(3m 14s • esc to interrupt)\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[77X\u001b[67;133H\u001b[1K\u001b[48;5;238m\r\n \u001b[132X\u001b[1m\r\n›\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[48;5;238m \u001b[2mImplement {feature}\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[48;5;238m\u001b[112X\r\n \u001b[132X\u001b[49m\u001b[71;133H\u001b[1K\u001b[2m\r  gpt-5.4 xhigh · /demo/miniOdyssey\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[?12l\u001b[?25h\u001b[64;1H\u001b[2m─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\u001b(B\u00