y.\u001b[21;133H\u001b[1K\u001b[32m\u001b[1m\r\n•\u001b(B\u001b[m \u001b[1mRan\u001b(B\u001b[m \u001b[38;5;111mdx-pubmed\u001b[38;5;189m search\u001b[38;5;103m --\u001b[38;5;217mquery\u001b[38;5;189m \u001b[38;5;151m\"DOCK8 hyper IgE syndrome pneumatoceles facial features\"\u001b[38;5;103m --\u001b[38;5;217mabstracts\u001b[39m\u001b[34X\u001b[23;133H\u001b[1K\u001b[2m\r  └ {\u001b(B\u001b[m\r\n    \u001b[2m  \"query\": \"DOCK8 hyper IgE syndrome pneumatoceles facial features\",\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[61X\u001b[25;133H\u001b[1K\u001b[2m\r    … +39 lines (ctrl + t to view transcript)\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[26;133H\u001b[1K\r    \u001b[2m  ]\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[27;133H\u001b[1K\r    \u001b[2m}\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[28;133H\u001b[1K\u001b[32m\u001b[1m\r\n•\u001b(B\u001b[m \u001b[1mRan\u001b(B\u001b[m \u001b[38;5;111mdx-pubmed\u001b[38;5;189m search\u001b[38;5;103m --\u001b[38;5;217mquery\u001b[38;5;189m \u001b[38;5;151m\"IL6ST hyper IgE syndrome pneumatocele\"\u001b[38;5;103m --\u001b[38;5;217mabstracts\u001b[39m\u001b[51X\u001b[30;133H\u001b[1K\u001b[2m\r  └ {\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[31;133H\u001b[1K\r    \u001b[2m  \"query\": \"IL6ST hyper IgE syndrome pneumatocele\",\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[32;133H\u001b[1K\u001b[2m\r    … +49 lines (ctrl + t to view transcript)\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[33;133H\u001b[1K\r    \u001b[2m  ]\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[34;133H\u001b[1K\r    \u001b[2m}\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[35;133H\u001b[1K\u001b[32m\u001b[1m\r\n•\u001b(B\u001b[m \u001b[1mRan\u001b(B\u001b[m \u001b[38;5;111mdx-pubmed\u001b[38;5;189m search\u001b[38;5;103m --\u001b[38;5;217mquery\u001b[38;5;189m \u001b[38;5;151m\"ZNF341 hyper IgE syndrome facial features\"\u001b[38;5;103m --\u001b[38;5;217mabstracts\u001b[39m\u001b[47X\u001b[37;133H\u001b[1K\u001b[2m\r  └ {\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[38;133H\u001b[1K\r    \u001b[2m  \"query\": \"ZNF341 hyper IgE syndrome facial features\",\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[39;133H\u001b[1K\u001b[2m\r    … +82 lines (ctrl + t to view transcript)\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[40;133H\u001b[1K\r    \u001b[2m  ]\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[41;133H\u001b[1K\r    \u001b[2m}\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[42;133H\u001b[1K\u001b[2m\r\n• \u001b[7mI'm looking into IL6ST variants and their relationship with STAT3, particularly how they can lead to \"original hyper-IgE syndrome.\"\u001b(B\u001b[m\r\n  \u001b[2m\u001b[7mI wonder if there's a way to differentiate the cases related to IL6ST, especially since dysmorphic facies could also be involved.\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[2X\r\n  \u001b[2m\u001b[7mIt's interesting to consider the implications of these genetic factors and how they might manifest in different individuals. Let's\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[1X\n\u001b[1K\r  \u001b[2m\u001b[7msee what more I can find on this topic!\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[47;133H\u001b[1K\n\u001b[1K\r  \u001b[1m\u001b[2m\u001b[7mEvaluating differential diagnoses\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[49;133H\u001b[1K\r\n  \u001b[2m\u001b[7mThis seems like a solid plan. The differential includes Chronic Granulomatous Disease (CGD), but I wonder if it’s a more nuanced\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[3X\r\n  \u001b[2m\u001b[7mclinical picture. Maybe I need to consider IL6ST/ZNF341 either as a separate di"]
